1
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:18,486
Writing, task one. Form number 6. You are looking for a new job. Answer the questions in the job agency questionnaire. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

2
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,901
What job do you do now?

3
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:35,611
I currently work as a warehouse worker in a big company, loading and unloading goods.

4
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,574
What job are you looking for and why?

5
00:00:48,967 --> 00:00:54,075
I'm looking for an office job because I studied economics and want to work in my field.

6
00:00:54,967 --> 00:00:56,784
When can you start work?

7
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:10,694
I can start on the first of December because I have to hand in my notice.

8
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:19,972
Fill in form 6 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.

9
00:01:21,710 --> 00:01:34,371
Writing, task one. Form number 7. You want to rent a car. Answer the questions in the form. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

10
00:01:35,077 --> 00:01:37,421
For how many days and when do you want to rent the car?

11
00:01:47,810 --> 00:01:52,756
I want to rent the car for four days, from Friday the twelfth to Monday the fifteenth of July.

12
00:01:53,643 --> 00:01:55,183
Where are you going and why?

13
00:02:05,577 --> 00:02:09,776
We're going to Šumava with the family because we want to see the mountains and go hiking.

14
00:02:10,677 --> 00:02:12,751
What car do you need and why?

15
00:02:23,143 --> 00:02:28,074
I need a big car for five people because we have three children and lots of luggage.

16
00:02:29,110 --> 00:02:41,944
Writing, task one. Form number 8. You want to register with a new GP. Answer the questions in the form. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

17
00:02:42,643 --> 00:02:44,509
Why are you looking for a new doctor?

18
00:02:54,910 --> 00:02:59,889
I'm looking for a new doctor because I moved and my old doctor is too far away.

19
00:03:00,777 --> 00:03:03,309
Do you have any health problems or allergies?

20
00:03:13,710 --> 00:03:17,939
I have no serious health problems, but I'm allergic to pollen and penicillin.

21
00:03:18,843 --> 00:03:20,422
When can you go to the doctor?

22
00:03:30,810 --> 00:03:34,943
I can go to the doctor in the morning before work or on Friday afternoon when I'm free.

23
00:03:36,010 --> 00:03:47,651
Writing, task one. Form number 9. You want to join a sports club. Answer the questions in the application. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

24
00:03:48,343 --> 00:03:50,278
Which sport would you like to do with us?

25
00:04:00,677 --> 00:04:04,428
I'd like to play volleyball with you because it's a team sport and I enjoy it.

26
00:04:05,343 --> 00:04:06,754
Why do you want to do sport?

27
00:04:17,143 --> 00:04:20,628
I want to do sport because I sit at work all day and I want to be healthy.

28
00:04:21,543 --> 00:04:23,338
What sports did you do before?

29
00:04:33,743 --> 00:04:36,908
I used to play football at school and went swimming for several years.

30
00:04:37,977 --> 00:04:51,043
Writing, task one. Form number 10. You want to order internet for your home. Answer the questions in the form. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

31
00:04:51,744 --> 00:04:54,236
Where do you live and how many people live with you?

32
00:05:04,644 --> 00:05:09,152
I live in Kralupy on Nádražní street, and my wife and two sons live with me.

33
00:05:10,044 --> 00:05:11,953
What will you use the internet for?

34
00:05:22,344 --> 00:05:26,690
We will use the internet for working from home, for the children's school and for films.

35
00:05:27,577 --> 00:05:29,203
When can the technician come?

36
00:05:39,610 --> 00:05:43,729
The technician can come on Saturday morning or on a weekday after five o'clock.

37
00:05:47,277 --> 00:05:52,164
Writing, task two. E-mail number 6: Noise in the building.

38
00:05:52,877 --> 00:06:03,511
Your neighbour makes noise at night. Write an e-mail to the building manager. Write at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

39
00:06:12,210 --> 00:06:13,277
Good afternoon,

40
00:06:13,577 --> 00:06:16,699
I live at Lobečská 12, on the third floor.

41
00:06:17,010 --> 00:06:19,192
I have a problem with my neighbour on the fourth floor.

42
00:06:19,477 --> 00:06:21,756
Every evening he plays music very loudly.

43
00:06:22,044 --> 00:06:24,225
It's always from ten in the evening until two at night.

44
00:06:24,510 --> 00:06:27,582
I get up at four in the morning for work and I can't sleep.

45
00:06:27,877 --> 00:06:30,354
Could you please talk to the neighbour?

46
00:06:30,644 --> 00:06:31,612
Thank you.

47
00:06:31,910 --> 00:06:38,669
This e-mail has 53 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

48
00:06:39,543 --> 00:06:44,533
Writing, task two. E-mail number 7: A Czech course.

49
00:06:45,243 --> 00:06:56,031
You want to sign up for a Czech course. Write an e-mail to the language school. Write at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

50
00:07:04,743 --> 00:07:05,810
Good afternoon,

51
00:07:06,110 --> 00:07:09,678
I would like to sign up for a Czech course for lower-intermediate learners.

52
00:07:09,976 --> 00:07:13,998
I want to learn Czech because I'm going to take the permanent residence exam.

53
00:07:14,310 --> 00:07:17,808
I'm free on Tuesday and Thursday evenings, I work during the day.

54
00:07:18,110 --> 00:07:20,002
I'd like to pay by bank transfer.

55
00:07:20,310 --> 00:07:26,389
You can call me on 777 456 123 or write me an e-mail.

56
00:07:26,676 --> 00:07:27,645
Thank you.

57
00:07:27,943 --> 00:07:34,974
This e-mail has 56 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

58
00:07:35,843 --> 00:07:40,912
Writing, task two. E-mail number 8: Children's party.

59
00:07:41,610 --> 00:07:52,997
You want to hold your son's birthday party. Write an e-mail to a children's centre. Write at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

60
00:08:01,710 --> 00:08:02,776
Good afternoon,

61
00:08:03,076 --> 00:08:05,433
I would like to hold a birthday party at your place.

62
00:08:05,743 --> 00:08:07,448
My son will be ten years old.

63
00:08:07,743 --> 00:08:10,851
We'd like the party on Saturday 14 March in the afternoon.

64
00:08:11,143 --> 00:08:12,533
Twelve children will come.

65
00:08:12,843 --> 00:08:15,879
We'd like a programme with games and face painting.

66
00:08:16,176 --> 00:08:19,130
For food we'd like pizza, lemonade and a cake.

67
00:08:19,443 --> 00:08:20,756
How much will it cost?

68
00:08:21,043 --> 00:08:28,263
This e-mail has 48 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

69
00:08:29,143 --> 00:08:34,511
Writing, task two. E-mail number 9: A lost bag.

70
00:08:35,210 --> 00:08:45,067
You lost your bag on a train. Write an e-mail to Czech Railways. Write at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

71
00:08:53,776 --> 00:08:54,843
Good afternoon,

72
00:08:55,143 --> 00:08:57,172
yesterday I lost my bag on the train.

73
00:08:57,476 --> 00:08:59,351
I was travelling by train from Kralupy to Prague.

74
00:08:59,643 --> 00:09:01,835
It was on Monday morning at seven o'clock.

75
00:09:02,143 --> 00:09:04,568
The bag is black, leather and small.

76
00:09:04,876 --> 00:09:07,997
In the bag there are documents, a wallet and keys.

77
00:09:08,310 --> 00:09:15,060
Please, if you find it, call me on 604 321 987. Thank you.

78
00:09:15,376 --> 00:09:22,817
This e-mail has 52 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

79
00:09:23,643 --> 00:09:27,708
Writing, task two. E-mail number 10: A wedding.

80
00:09:28,410 --> 00:09:38,815
Your friend has invited you to her wedding, but you can't come. Write her an e-mail of at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

81
00:09:47,510 --> 00:09:48,544
Hi Petra,

82
00:09:48,843 --> 00:09:52,030
Hi Petra, thank you very much for the invitation to your wedding.

83
00:09:52,343 --> 00:09:57,149
Unfortunately I can't come because that day I'm flying to Ukraine to see my mum, she is ill.

84
00:09:57,443 --> 00:10:00,129
I'll send you a present by post, it's a set of glasses.

85
00:10:00,443 --> 00:10:03,618
We can meet for coffee next week, maybe on Wednesday.

86
00:10:03,910 --> 00:10:05,915
I wish you lots of love and happiness.

87
00:10:06,210 --> 00:10:07,305
Yours, Ivan

88
00:10:07,610 --> 00:10:14,497
This e-mail has 49 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and at the end.

89
00:10:15,210 --> 00:10:24,220
Write your own e-mail on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
